cademy/question-capture/14071857/assets/a2cee4b60fe7cf45df5cca5c0d513c38f6639b08486272d9cb4e605b8359935c.png)\n\nGiven the sets $A={d,i,f,e,r}$ and $B={f,e,r,a,k},$ find $B∖A.$" :question/worked-solution "The difference $B∖A$ consists of all the elements that are in $B$ but not $A.$ To represent $B∖A,$ we will shade in all the area that is contained in $B$ but not $A.$\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14071857/assets/7ec40584f82d7bd01aa7323ffb9cc4a53d631b74ea1d312d1b4141eb5da8d0d9.png)\n\nThe elements $a$ and $k$ are in $B$ but not $A.$\n\nTherefore, the difference is\n\n$$\nB∖A={a,k}.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-81518/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "4687dcd7-a5ab-5dc6-be6d-89d806a61a02"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-81518"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-86701/selection/4fc2109030bd557911779c56c6087b832f469b95f3d9bd83e8f76bbad8767b19" :answer/id #uuid "32a75745-0add-57d6-a68c-dbbf69d2cc1d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{0,1,3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-86701/selection/7a3c0f200b470c3efb789627ca64d2275544ad82bbbf3d9aa820bedf1f6bd0f7" :answer/id #uuid "9e57f06c-d18f-56c8-9629-fffc7a4a6053" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{0,1,3,5,7,9}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-86701/selection/2531b01062963bf17cb1953367062769d91dcfc4519f4f6b120c5de4951d40dd" :answer/id #uuid "1e8bdc02-f11c-5a11-b55e-625f43d09434" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "∅" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-86701/selection/b4f7a8ae4f24716af6b2827857425ffec7ef17a06d09cf111851ab7fd3d1c0f6" :answer/id #uuid "b17c5dad-b027-5b9f-8e43-32c00318a0b5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{5,7}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-86701/selection/a9996c26738f86854270845a5480433e0d150abe498e0ea8700f1c168e10728d" :answer/id #uuid "87e937eb-3ec9-557a-8fa1-